{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0004-bradley-terry-elo-unification.md", "equation": "Ternary (Rao-Kupper style): log[P(Y_ij=win)/(P(draw)+P(lose))] = L_ij; log[(P(draw)+P(win))/P(lose)] = L_ij + φ; hence P(win) = σ(L_ij), P(lose) = σ(−L_ij − φ), P(draw) = σ(−L_ij) − σ(−L_ij − φ).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9121}
